## Execution
Runs: batch

Submit `scripts/submit.sh` using `python3 <workspace>/_system/executorlib.py submit --workspace <project> <analysis>/scripts/submit.sh`, through the project's configured Slurm executor. Request one CPU, 4 GB RAM and 15 minutes; expected runtime is under five minutes and declared outputs under 10 MB for this six-sample analysis. Capture stdout/stderr under the analysis directory. All computation runs in the batch job. Missing dependencies, input validation failures or scheduler errors are reported and execution stops; changes to the approved method require a new plan.
